  "description": "On the night of her eighteenth birthday, Faith Williams meets the boy of her nightmares — Death himself. Unbeknownst to her, Death has come to collect on a forgotten promise Faith made long ago. But when she refuses to comply, Faith's reality twist into something unrecognizable. Torn between Death’s dark pull and her growing connection to David Star— a golden boy with secrets of his own - Faith is left questioning everything and everyone. With the truth buried in her past, Faith must uncover who she really is...before Death finally claims what he was promised.\nSource: Webtoon",
